  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OGEngine.Client v2.0.5\n\nNative AOT .NET client for the WEB4 OASIS API and WEB5 STAR API, plus P/Invoke interop exports for OGEngine-based games (OQuake, ODOOM etc). Handles avatar auth, inventory, quests, XP, karma, NFT minting and sync callbacks — bridging the OASIS/STAR platform directly into native game engines.\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.4\n- Initial validated package contents and metadata for this release line.\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/OASIS Omniverse/OGEngineClient",
